# The glossary: the core terms of the game, in one place. Translators: keep a term the same
# everywhere it appears (menus, tooltips, the encyclopedia); messages may insert a term with
# `{ glossary.city }`. The terms follow the usual vocabulary of the genre (the translations
# aim at what players of that language already know from similar games); the tooltips of
# the units, yields and terrain below use them.
#
# Lower case, singular, as it stands inside a sentence. A language that needs a capital
# at the start of a sentence writes the message in full instead of inserting the term.

